  "content": "<p>這個資源包旨在重新著色所有與原始寶可夢顏色無差異的閃光寶可夢。</p><p>目前僅新增了炭小侍的進化形態，未來將會加入更多內容</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_789c1392-6e73-408d-a194-7d81a114c412.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"216\" height=\"222\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1269523/description_76a27ab1-ede2-401c-b25d-ebed76c6348e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"225\"></p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p>同時新增與Xaero's Minimap圖標的兼容性，若您已安裝Emery319製作的該資源包，請將本資源包置於其上層：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ebe57273-fd8d-45a7-97cb-eb7ce572ce12.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
